OL,3,AAndy Burnham to face Kemi Badenoch at
OL,4,APMQs
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham is set to face
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch at
OL,8,FPrime Minister's Questions - watch live
OL,9,Fabove from 12:00 GMT
OL,11,FIt comes as a new forecast says energy
OL,12,Fbills could go up by #443 a year from
OL,13,FJanuary. In last month's Budget, the
OL,14,Fgovernment promised a #100 payment for
OL,15,Fpeople living in homes in council tax
OL,16,Fbands A to D in England to help cover
OL,17,Fwinter energy costs
OL,19,FMeanwhile, figures released earlier
OL,20,Fshow the rate of inflation rose again
OL,21,Fin the year to October, hitting 3.6% -
OL,22,Fthe highest rate in a year
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
